          %p
            See (
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"}> Lurie, example 1.1.4
            ).
          %h4#CoreflectionOfGroupoidsIntoPrecategories Coreflection into pre-category objects
          %p
            In order to state the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complete+Segal+space"} completeness condition
            on a precategory object, def.
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PreCategoryObject"}
            = succeed "," do
