          %p
            See also at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-category+object+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} n-category object in an (∞,1)-category
          %h3#enriched_categories_as_internal_categories Enriched categories as internal categories
          %p
            The 1-categorical notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+category"} enriched category
            is similar to that of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+category"} internal category
            %em object of objects
